<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="543475186"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:20.920"><div begin="29.536" end="57.481" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="29.536" end="35.401" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.536" end="31.453">听你说什</span><span begin="31.453" end="31.770">幺</span> <span begin="31.770" end="32.160">我</span><span begin="32.160" end="32.720">都</span><span begin="32.720" end="33.996">很</span><span begin="33.996" end="34.409">快</span><span begin="34.409" end="35.401">乐</span></p><p begin="36.607" end="42.238" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.607" end="37.598">接近</span><span begin="37.598" end="37.954">你</span> <span begin="37.954" end="39.187">连影子</span><span begin="39.187" end="39.803">都</span><span begin="39.803" end="40.985">微</span><span begin="40.985" end="41.434">笑</span><span begin="41.434" end="42.238">着</span></p><p begin="42.355" end="49.525" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.355" end="43.257">几千</span><span begin="43.257" end="44.627">只</span><span begin="44.627" end="44.984">纸</span><span begin="44.984" end="46.070">鹤</span> <span begin="46.199" end="46.916">你都耐</span><span begin="46.916" end="48.905">心地陪着我</span><span begin="48.905" end="49.525">折</span></p><p begin="49.819" end="57.481" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.819" end="51.647">却怎麼都</span><span begin="51.647" end="51.977">折</span><span begin="51.977" end="52.453">不</span><span begin="52.453" end="53.543">掉</span> <span begin="53.543" end="55.636">那道无形的</span><span begin="55.636" end="56.609">隔</span><span begin="56.609" end="57.481">阂</span></p></div><div begin="57.808" end="1:23.901" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="57.808" end="1:03.681" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.808" end="59.172">越懂你</span> <span begin="59.172" end="59.608">陪</span><span begin="59.608" end="59.857">着</span><span begin="59.857" end="1:00.364">你</span><span begin="1:00.364" end="1:00.926">就</span><span begin="1:00.926" end="1:02.255">越</sp