nd="1:28.107">是</span><span begin="1:28.107" end="1:28.573">朋</span><span begin="1:28.573" end="1:29.170">友</span> <span begin="1:29.170" end="1:29.598">不</span><span begin="1:29.598" end="1:29.848">能</span><span begin="1:29.848" end="1:30.738">够占</span><span begin="1:30.738" end="1:31.368">有</span></p><p begin="1:31.378" end="1:38.386" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.378" end="1:32.665">好朋友</span><span begin="1:32.665" end="1:33.140">疯</span><span begin="1:33.140" end="1:33.392">狂</span><span begin="1:33.392" end="1:33.839">以</span><span begin="1:33.839" end="1:34.436">后</span> <span begin="1:34.436" end="1:34.914">就</span><span begin="1:34.914" end="1:35.453">一个</span><span begin="1:35.453" end="1:35.830">人</span><span begin="1:35.830" end="1:36.715">走</span> <span begin="1:36.715" end="1:37.541">无</span><span begin="1:37.541" end="1:37.844">所</span><span begin="1:37.844" end="1:38.386">求</span></p><p begin="1:38.396" end="1:45.526" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.396" end="1:38.854">好</span><span begin="1:38.854" end="1:39.156">朋</span><span begin="1:39.156" end="1:39.706">友</span><span begin="1:39.706" end="1:40.194">只</span><span begin="1:40.194" end="1:40.443">是</span><span begin="1:40.443" end="1:40.913">朋</span><span begin="1:40.913" end="1:41.549">友</span> <span begin="1:41.549" end="1:42.170">只能</span><span begin="1:42.170" end="1:42.649">保</span><span begin="1:42.649" end="1:43.314">留</span><span begin="1:43.314" end="1:43.752">一</span><span begin="1:43.752" end="1:43.972">点</span><span begin="1:43.972" end="1:44.853">点温</span><span begin="1:44.853" end="1:45.526">柔</span></p><p begin="1:45.536" end="1:55.957" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.536" end="1:45.970">我</span><span begin="1:45.970" end="1:46.203">知</span><span begin="1:46.203" end="1:46.808">道</span><span begin="1:46.813" end="1:48.527">什麼时候</span><span begin="1:48.527" end="1:49.287">回</span><span begin="1:49.287" end="1:50.712">头</span> <sp